# Audit records: local-only (same decision, restated 2026-09-20 — AUD-11
# close-out). The published repo carries runtime files only, so the master
# audit's DISPOSITIONS travel inside the app instead: read them from the built
# artifact with `window._pf.auditRegister()`. The prose report stays here, is
# named by that register's `source`, and is what the suite cross-checks the
# shipped register against — so the record cannot drift from what shipped.
MASTER-AUDIT-*.md
PWA-AUDIT-REPORT-*.md
/docs/audits/

